# Sprint board: tokens are tasks, boxes are lanes
box todo "To do" at 160 300 size 220 300 states open|empty
box doing "In progress" at 420 300 size 220 300 states idle|busy|overloaded
box review "Review" at 680 300 size 220 300 states idle|waiting
box done "Done" at 940 300 size 220 300 states none|shipped
token t1 "Login page" on todo, doing, review, done offset 0 90
token t2 "Billing API" on todo, doing, review, done offset 0 135
token t3 "Dark mode" on todo, doing, review, done offset 0 180
switch blocked "Blocked on design" at 180 560 states off|blocked
note n1 "Drag a task between lanes.\nPlay the steps to replay the sprint." at 600 560
step "Monday: Login page starts" t1=1 doing=busy
step "Billing joins, the lane fills up" t2=1 doing=overloaded
step "Login goes to review" t1=2 review=waiting doing=busy
step "Dark mode blocked" blocked=blocked
step "Login ships" t1=3 done=shipped review=idle
